# ─── All optional. The app works with zero configuration. ───────────────────
# Every provider below is keyless by default; these keys only widen coverage
# and give the fallback chain more places to go when a host throttles you.

# Alpha Vantage — the single most useful key to add. Free tier covers FX
# dailies, US equity intraday + daily, and spot commodity series (WTI, Brent,
# natural gas, copper, wheat, corn, cotton, sugar, coffee), which is the only
# free source that reaches all three of this app's focus areas.
# https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY=

# Twelve Data — without a key the app falls back to the shared "demo" key,
# which only answers for a handful of FX majors. A free key unlocks FX,
# equities and commodity CFDs properly.
# https://twelvedata.com/pricing
TWELVEDATA_API_KEY=

# Pyth / Hermes — feed metadata (~1,770 feeds: 1,262 equities, 39 FX pairs,
# 36 commodity contracts, 11 metals) is public and already used for the symbol
# universe and market-hours flags. Price reads now require a key.
PYTH_API_KEY=
